+    ... data.coupon_code, data.max_quantity, data.vendor_id ...
@@ UPDATE field allow-list / SQL SET clause
 Add `max_quantity` anywhere your model enumerates allowed update fields.

IMPORTANT: The customer cart API must enforce this server-side too. Before an insert/update,
load the coupon and reject `requestedQuantity > coupon.max_quantity`; do not rely only on
disabling the + button in the customer UI. The customer UI should use `coupon.max_quantity`
as the + button limit (default to 1 for older API responses).
